@page
@model PersonalTools.Pages.CookiesModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Cookies"; }

<div class="container px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p class="eyebrow">Last updated: 15 August 2026</p><h1 class="page-title">Cookies</h1><p class="page-subtitle section-spacing">Personal Tools uses only the storage needed for security, sign-in, and preferences you choose.</p><div class="card border-0 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5"><section class="mb-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">Authentication and security</h2><p class="small-muted">The cookies below are first-party and used only to deliver a secure service you request. They are not used for advertising, analytics, or cross-site tracking.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Storage</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody id="cookieTableRows"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="mb-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">Remember me</h2><p class="small-muted mb-0">Remember me is optional and off by default. When you actively enable it at login, the authentication cookie can persist for up to 14 days so you do not need to sign in each visit. Do not select it on a shared device. You can withdraw this choice by signing out or clearing the site’s cookies in your browser.</p></section><section class="mb-4"><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">Browser local storage</h2><p class="small-muted mb-0">Personal Tools may store your theme choice, Notes layout/order, and CS Match Tracker preferences (which stats you've chosen to show, your Edit Stats filters, and your list/card view choice, kept separately per match-tracking profile) in your browser’s local storage. This stays on your device and is used only to remember choices you made in the interface.</p></section><section><h2 class="h5 fw-semibold">No optional tracking</h2><p class="small-muted mb-0">Personal Tools does not use analytics, advertising, social-media tracking pixels, or third-party tracking cookies. If that changes, this page will be updated and consent will be requested before any non-essential storage is used.</p></section></div></div></div></div></div>
@section Scripts { <script src="~/js/pages/page-cookies.js" asp-append-version="true"></script> }
